<article class="article">
<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Honda Click vs Honda Vision: Hanoi Rental Cost Comparison</h1>
<p>The Honda Click rents at a verified 150,000 VND per day, 700,000 VND per week and 900,000 to 1,200,000 VND per month in Hanoi. The Honda Vision rents at a verified 200,000 VND per day, 1,000,000 VND per week and 1,800,000 to 2,000,000 VND per month, the monthly confirmed at the counter as a range. This comparison puts the two best-known automatics in the fleet side by side honestly: they share a shape and a transmission, and they differ by 50,000 VND per day, 300,000 VND per week and roughly a million VND per month.</p>
<p>We compare the daily, weekly and monthly structures, the break-even logic each ladder produces, what the Vision's premium actually buys as a ride, who each machine suits, and the deposit, gear and licensing questions that come with the choice. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The verified price ladders</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">Daily rate comparison</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">Weekly and monthly comparison</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">The break-even logic</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">What the Vision's premium buys</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">Who each machine suits</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-7">Deposits, gear and licensing</a></li>
